;; EXPECT: sort-error
;; TYPES: machine
;; MESSAGE: operator 'a' is already declared
;; A second declaration of one operator panicked in the registry ("already registered");
;; found with bug #7 on 2026-10-06. It is a sort error.
(sort E)
(function a () E)
(function a () E)
